u closer to the summit - or sends you tumbling down.\n\nDesigned for VR, this immersive experience lets you feel the strain of the climb and the thrill of reaching new heights. Master the terrain, embrace your animal instincts, and uncover the hidden strength it takes to conquer the peak of the mountain.\n\nAre you ready to climb very high? Hope you are not scared of heights! ", "short_description": "Embark on a thrilling VR climb up Peak Mountain, where you take on the role of a single animal adventurer scaling dizzying heights in PEAKS CLIMB: ANIMALS VR."}]}, "developer_name": "MB Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MB Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://MbGameStudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24605101202453654"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 7, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1050690147871268"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2059205431362000"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1358068253022912"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1486468385800424"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3910830905875939"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "769266345719405"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "678078991980336"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "678078991980336"}, "is_approved": true, "f